SUMMARY:Houston Code & Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Houston Code and Coffee\nCode & Coffee is a friendly\, low-pre
 ssure meetup for coders and code-curious. All skill levels are welcome!\n\
 nCome hang out and meet people. If you want to co-work\, feel free to brin
 g a laptop or a project.\n\n**What to expect**\n\n1. **Arrival and Set up*
 *\n\n* Get in and hang out a bit. It's Houston traffic\, so show up any ti
 me before we end.\n\n2. **Announcements**\n\n* We will start with some sli
 des and news. Sometimes we have a lightning talk presentation.\n\n3. **Qui
 ck Intro Circle**\n\n* This is low pressure\, everything is low pressure. 
 Just try to remember your name\, what you can help with\, and what you nee
 d help with.\n\n4. **Open Networking**\n\n* The rest of the time is for ch
 ating or co-working.\n\nWe have plenty of coffee and soft drinks available
  for the caffienated types. There is also a filtered water dispenser.\n\n*
 *🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Code & Coffee Discord (The in-between spot)**\n[www.co
 deandcoffee.chat](http://www.codeandcoffee.chat/) \\- Be sure to select Ho
 uston as your city\\. The career and coding help forums are a great resour
 ce\\.\n\n**Shout out to our venue host - Improving!**\n"[Improving](https:
 //www.improving.com/locations/houston/) is dedicated to building and advan
 cing a great work culture that exemplifies teamwork\, excellence\, and fun
 ! We believe this inspires and motivates all of us while establishing life
 -long relationships. Improving is a long-time supporter of the Conscious C
 apitalism movement. We work to serve the interests of all our stakeholders
 \, establishing trust along the way."
